          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most buyers, the Honda EU2200i is still the best inverter generator: quiet, light, reliable and equipped with CO-MINDER shutoff. If you need more output for a real outage load, the Westinghouse iGen4500 is the better home backup machine, and the Champion 2500 and WEN 56380i stretch a budget furthest.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
